    {
      "block_id": "2009.00031_p3_b4",
      "text": "CXOU J181335.16\u2212174957.4 (PSR J1813\u22121749)\n6685\n18:13:35.151(2)\n\u221217:49:57.10(3)\n17695\n18:13:35.100(6)\n\u221217:49:57.24(8)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203273(10)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203214(9)\n17440\n18:13:35.112(6)\n\u221217:49:57.57(7)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203255(10)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203247(8)\nCXOU J181314.20\u2212175343.4 (src24)\n6685\n18:13:14.204(4)\n\u221217:53:43.12(5)\n17695\n18:13:14.200(6)\n\u221217:53:43.13(12)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203205(11)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203201(13)\n17440\n18:13:14.229(6)\n\u221217:53:43.37(8)\n+0.\u2032\u203236(11)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203225(9)\nCXOU J181322.48\u2212175350.2 (src37)\n6685\n18:13:22.510(13)\n\u221217:53:50.00(7)\n17695\n18:13:22.487(5)\n\u221217:53:50.16(11)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203233(20)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203216(13)\n17440\n18:13:22.518(5)\n\u221217:53:50.13(6)\n+0.\u2032\u203211(20)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203213(9)\nCXOU J181323.71\u2212175040.5 (src41)\n6685\n18:13:23.719(3)\n\u221217:50:40.21(3)\n17695\n18:13:23.701(6)\n\u221217:50:40.41(15)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203226(10)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203220(15)\n17440\n18:13:23.722(9)\n\u221217:50:40.36(13)\n+0.\u2032\u203204(13)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203215(13)\nCXOU J181341.20\u2212175115.4 (src65)\n6685\n18:13:41.210(8)\n\u221217:51:15.11(17)\n17695\n18:13:41.158(16)\n\u221217:51:15.66(19)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203274(25)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203255(25)\n17440\n18:13:41.190(26)\n\u221217:51:15.77(30)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203228(38)\n\u22120.\u2032\u203266(34)\n",
